sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant UI as Angular app
    participant API as Trade REST API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant K as Kafka
    participant EX as Order executor
    participant FX as Fauxnance API

    C->>UI: Place an order
    UI->>API: POST /api/v1/orders (Bearer JWT)
    API->>DB: Validate and record the order as NEW
    API->>K: orders: ORDER_PLACED (key accountId)
    API-->>UI: Order accepted, shown as received

    K->>EX: orders (group trade-executor)
    EX->>FX: Quote, plus FX rate if currencies differ
    EX->>EX: Fill rule decides to fill or reject
    alt Filled
        EX->>DB: One transaction: cash, position, order marked FILLED
        EX->>K: trade-events: ORDER_FILLED
    else Rejected
        EX->>DB: Order marked REJECTED with the reason
        EX->>K: trade-events: ORDER_REJECTED
    end

    K->>API: trade-events (group fee-deduction-service)
    API->>DB: BUY or SELL transaction, then the fee and a FEE transaction (once per order)

    K->>API: trade-events (group order-notifications)
    API->>DB: Store the outcome once per event
    API->>API: Resolve the customer's channels,<br/>send email and SMS stubs

    loop every 5 s after an order, 30 s otherwise
        UI->>API: GET order-notifications after the last id seen
    end
    API-->>UI: New outcome
    UI-->>C: Notification bell shows the result
